  id: K2D2
  name: K2-D2
  author: IanMealworm
  description: 'K2-D2 is an astromech-style autopilot suite for KSP2: maneuver node
    execution with orbit circularization, ascent guidance, automated landing, docking,
    and attitude hold, all from one panel (Alt-O or AppBar). Port of Christophe Floutier''s
    original K2-D2 (built for SpaceWarp1) to the Redux modding framework.'
